# The LEGS of a built Walkway deck: four upright legs at the corners (Models/walkway.obj `WalkwayLeg`: the top at the
# entity's y, 2.6 m long). The game puts the root on the Walkway's own origin, UNTILTED, and moves each leg up or down
# so its top meets the tilted deck's ledger over it (StructureSystem::updateWalkway); the long foot goes into the ground.
# Render-only: the deck (walkwayDeck.pre) carries the collider. The Position y here is the untilted deck's ledger.
Prefab gameWalkwayLegs
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Leg
			Position -0.8 -0.34 -0.8
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer walkway
				Node WalkwayLeg
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.5 0.36 0.2
